1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:01,705
(Sheldon:)Well...

2
00:00:04,955 --> 00:00:07,745
(Penny:)Yeah, yeah, I guess.
But look, he signed it.

3
00:00:07,916 --> 00:00:10,706
(Sheldon:)Do you realize what this means?

4
00:00:12,754 --> 00:00:17,964
(Sheldon:)All I need is a healthy ovum
and I can grow my own Leonard Nimoy.

5
00:00:22,055 --> 00:00:26,055
(Penny:)Okay, all I'm giving you is the napkin,
Sheldon.

6
00:00:28,395 --> 00:00:30,225
(Sheldon:)Be right back.

7
00:00:32,732 --> 00:00:34,772
- Here, open it.
- Oh.

8
00:00:37,237 --> 00:00:38,567
(Raj:)Oh.

9
00:00:38,738 --> 00:00:42,078
(Leonard:)A gift certificate for motorcycle lessons.

10
00:00:44,244 --> 00:00:46,494
(Leonard:)- Very thoughtful.
- Yeah, and I checked.

11
00:00:46,663 --> 00:00:51,123
(Penny:)Not letting the bike fall on you
while standing still is lesson one.

12
00:00:51,877 --> 00:00:54,377
(Leonard:)Oh, then I think you'll appreciate
what I got you.

13
00:00:54,546 --> 00:00:56,256
(Howard:)Okay.

14
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:08,029
"101 Totally Cool Science Experiments
for Kids."

